        <p>• Firebase (Google): sign-in (your account ID and password check), App Check (confirms requests come from the real Melai Nuts app), push notifications and crash reports.</p><p>• Supabase: our database, file storage and server functions, where your business data is kept.</p><p>• Resend: sends Melai Nuts account emails: the 6-digit codes, password-reset and email-change links, and security notices.</p><p>• Cloudflare Turnstile: the security check shown when you create an account and after repeated failed sign-ins.</p><p>• HitPay: online payments. We receive the payment status, amount and method, not your card or GCash details.</p><p>• OpenStreetMap: the map tiles in the app.</p><p>A copy of recent data is kept on your phone so the app works offline; it is erased when you sign out. On a staff or owner phone this copy also includes the branch&#x27;s inventory and the e-receipts of recent orders, which show the customer&#x27;s name and contact number when the order has them (section 12). Staff see only what their branch needs.</p>
