    <section id="privacy-9">
        <h2>9. Product photos and file access</h2>
        <ul><li>What we collect: the product photos the Melai Nuts owner chooses on the admin website, with each photo&#x27;s file type, size and upload time, the product it belongs to, and the owner account that uploaded it. Only the owner uploads product photos; customers do not.</li><li>Why: to show the products to customers in the Melai Nuts app and the web shop.</li><li>File access: the website reads only the photo files the owner picks in the browser&#x27;s file picker (or drags onto the page). It does not scan or read any other files or folders on the device. The owner first allows file access with the &quot;Allow photo access&quot; button; the website records that owner&#x27;s choice and when it was made, and the owner can reset it at any time.</li><li>Where they are stored: in Supabase Storage, in the public &quot;product-images&quot; folder. Anyone with a photo&#x27;s link can view it, so private or personal photos must not be uploaded.</li><li>Large photos are resized in the browser before they are uploaded.</li><li>The owner can remove or replace photos at any time. Removed and replaced photos are deleted from storage.</li><li>Questions about product photos: email melaioraya5&#64;gmail.com.</li></ul>
